# `collections.list`

All collections, including system ones (flagged system=true).

**Policy** — read (C0, safe). Capability `ship.collection.read`.

## Arguments

None.

## Returns

`CollectionList` (JSON).

| field | type |
|-------|------|
| `collections` | `map` |

## Invoke

```
ship ops call collections.list --json '{}'
```

Kind: read.

## Example response

```json
{
  "collections": [
    {
      "id": "notes",
      "title": "Notes",
      "item_count": 3
    },
    {
      "id": "feedback",
      "title": "Feedback",
      "system": true
    }
  ]
}
```
